MODULE: BudgetChangeResetsDebt
TARGET: BudgetChangeDeferred
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: changing registry budget incorrectly resets active bucket debt before refresh
PERTURBS: ChangeBudget

--- FIND
    /\ rate' = newRate
    /\ changed' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<live, joined, left, restarted, now, phase, cycles, age,
                   grant, configured, emission, tolerance, tat, demand, cancelled>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ rate' = newRate
    /\ changed' = TRUE
    /\ tat' = [s \in Silos |-> 0]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<live, joined, left, restarted, now, phase, cycles, age,
                   grant, configured, emission, tolerance, demand, cancelled>>
--- END
